		{
			dependencies: ["6D04014F7539F025"]
			description: [
				"Bountiful boards turn ordinary work into directed goals. Read the requested item and reward carefully before accepting, and avoid consuming rare progression materials for a weak payout."
				"Artifacts and relics often have slots, cooldowns or unusual activation rules. Read their tooltip, test them somewhere safe and compare overlapping effects before judging them."
				"The chronicle calls relics memories with weight. Carrying one should change how you prepare, not merely raise a number."
				"Better Archeology expands suspicious sand and gravel into a broader field practice with fossils, ruins, artifact shards, and analysis. Bring several brushes, light, scaffolding blocks, and empty protected inventory slots."
			]
